# Belt and braces. These are already excluded by .gitignore, so they
# should never reach the repo Vercel builds from — this file is what
# catches the day one of them does, because a Vercel deploy publishes
# the working tree and not just what git tracks.
#
# deploy-schema.sql is the whole database design. Not a key — security
# lives in the database, not in secrecy — but a free map for anyone
# poking at the API.
deploy-schema.sql
patch-*.sql
*.sql

# Build scripts. They read config.js and rewrite the pages; they are
# run before a deploy, never served by one.
sync-csp.js
sync-vendor.js
sync-sri.js
vendor-lock.json
sri-lock.json

# Pasted into Supabase -> Authentication -> Email Templates. Never served.
email-*.html

# Apache config. Inert on Vercel — vercel.json is what applies here.
# Shipping it invites someone to edit it and expect an effect.
.htaccess
_htaccess

README.md
LEGAL-COMPLIANCE.md
DEPLOY.txt
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
